Z||000005||DecadenceR||08-01-2001||01:35 AM||||I recomment a 2" on that car, which is what I'm planning, and I LOVED my 5% tint. but that's illegal in most places so if you want it legal call your local Police Department.<BR>Brake calipers can eb painted with high-temp paint, but I actually saw a paint made for calipers in my local parts stores. FYI- unless you made mods that no one else here knows about, you don't have brake drums. 4 wheel disc.<BR>Chrome n the motor would be nice too. Can't help you there tho (yet). Good luck!!!||||reg||1
